Comment: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:32.18,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,鳴り響く静寂へと
Comment: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:37.65,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,今宵も暴虐に満たされる
Comment: 0,0:00:37.65,0:00:43.00,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,剥き出した罪の形
Comment: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:48.61,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,膨れ上がる　そう今、この眼(め)
Comment: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:58.75,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,歪んだ掌(て)の中繰り返す
Comment: 0,0:00:58.75,0:01:04.20,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,全て壊せ“そこから“こそ...
Comment: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:08.75,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,嗟呼(あぁ)始（はじ）められるだろう
Comment: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:15.08,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,赤く滴った魂を揺さぶる月
Comment: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:20.20,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,解き放たれた闇へ還れ
Comment: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:25.68,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,狂い堕とされた 譫妄(せんもう)の甘美な蜜に
Comment: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:33.55,Bey - Copy,,0,0,0,,舐めずにザラつく　運命喰い尽くすまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:32.18,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}Rumo o silêncio retumbante,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:37.65,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}mais uma noite satisfazendo-se da tirania.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.65,0:00:43.00,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}O pecado nu e cru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:48.61,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}intumesce agora, bem diante destes olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:58.75,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}Repetindo-se sobre a palma distorcida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:01:01.62,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}Destrua tudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:04.20,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}Somente "a partir daqui"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:08.75,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}Ah... que talvez tenha meu princípio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:15.08,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}A lua faz fremir minha alma coberta de sangue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:20.20,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}Retorne à escuridão desencadeada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:21.92,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}Levado à loucura
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:25.68,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}por um doce mel delirante
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.45,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}sem nem mesmo ter o colocado na boca,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:33.35,Bey,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1.5}até devorar o destino por completo.
